{"messages":[{"text":"🏛️ Moreno acusa a Sánchez de «indolencia arrogante» ante la crisis de Ceuta y dice que «no es capaz de dar la cara».\n🌶️ Ceuta arde políticamente y la campaña ya ha llegado con gasolina premium.","buttons":[{"label":"Abrir en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%9B%EF%B8%8F%20Moreno%20acusa%20a%20S%C3%A1nchez%20de%20%C2%ABindolencia%20arrogante%C2%BB%20ante%20la%20crisis%20de%20Ceuta%20y%20dice%20que%20%C2%ABno%20es%20capaz%20de%20dar%20la%20cara%C2%BB.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Ceuta%20arde%20pol%C3%ADticamente%20y%20la%20campa%C3%B1a%20ya%20ha%20llegado%20con%20gasolina%20premium."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 1 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%9B%EF%B8%8F%20Moreno%20acusa%20a%20S%C3%A1nchez%20de%20%C2%ABindolencia%20arrogante%C2%BB%20ante%20la%20crisis%20de%20Ceuta%20y%20dice%20que%20%C2%ABno%20es%20capaz%20de%20dar%20la%20cara%C2%BB.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Moreno%20no%20pide%20explicaciones%3A%20directamente%20abre%20la%20campa%C3%B1a%20a%20martillazos."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 2 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%9B%EF%B8%8F%20Moreno%20acusa%20a%20S%C3%A1nchez%20de%20%C2%ABindolencia%20arrogante%C2%BB%20ante%20la%20crisis%20de%20Ceuta%20y%20dice%20que%20%C2%ABno%20es%20capaz%20de%20dar%20la%20cara%C2%BB.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20La%20crisis%20sigue%20en%20Ceuta%3B%20el%20mitin%20ya%20est%C3%A1%20en%20toda%20Espa%C3%B1a."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 3 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%9B%EF%B8%8F%20Moreno%20acusa%20a%20S%C3%A1nchez%20de%20%C2%ABindolencia%20arrogante%C2%BB%20ante%20la%20crisis%20de%20Ceuta%20y%20dice%20que%20%C2%ABno%20es%20capaz%20de%20dar%20la%20cara%C2%BB.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20A%20este%20paso%2C%20Ceuta%20va%20a%20necesitar%20m%C3%A1s%20portavoces%20que%20polic%C3%ADas."}],"search_terms":["Moreno Sánchez Ceuta"]},{"text":"🌡️ Canarias suspende este martes las clases presenciales en Fuerteventura y en nueve municipios de Gran Ca